    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check also friend game</h1><p></p><br><h1>See also cool project</h1><p></p><br><h1>See partner game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Take a comfortable seat behind the wheel and get ready for an amazing adventure with <strong>Car Tune: Project</strong>! This incredible simulation game will make you feel like a real car tuner who can turn an ordinary car into a true beast. In Car Tune: Project, you'll have access to dozens of different car models that you can customize to your needs and tastes.<br><br>Do you want to increase the engine power? No problem - in the game, you'll find a wide range of options to do it in a way that meets your expectations. Do you dream of a beautiful and aggressive body that will catch people's eyes on the road? No problem - apply your knowledge and creativity to give your car an individual style. Add spoilers, change rims, adjust lights - in <strong>Car Tune: Project</strong>, there are no limits to your imagination.<br><br>After making all the changes, it's time to hit the track! Compete with other drivers who also don't spare their vehicles. Face them on different tracks and defeat them in a real fight for victory. Feel the emotions and adrenaline as you speed around the track at lightning speed and give it your all to reach the finish line first.<br><br><strong>Car Tune: Project</strong> is a game for automotive, tuning, and racing enthusiasts. Excellent graphics and sounds, realistic car models, and numerous personalization and tuning options make this game a real treat for fans of racing and automotive games. Enter the world of <strong>Car Tune: Project</strong> and start building your own cars - who knows, maybe you'll create a real legend?",
    "about_the_game": "Take a comfortable seat behind the wheel and get ready for an amazing adventure with <strong>Car Tune: Project</strong>! This incredible simulation game will make you feel like a real car tuner who can turn an ordinary car into a true beast. In Car Tune: Project, you'll have access to dozens of different car models that you can customize to your needs and tastes.<br><br>Do you want to increase the engine power? No problem - in the game, you'll find a wide range of options to do it in a way that meets your expectations. Do you dream of a beautiful and aggressive body that will catch people's eyes on the road? No problem - apply your knowledge and creativity to give your car an individual style. Add spoilers, change rims, adjust lights - in <strong>Car Tune: Project</strong>, there are no limits to your imagination.<br><br>After making all the changes, it's time to hit the track! Compete with other drivers who also don't spare their vehicles. Face them on different tracks and defeat them in a real fight for victory. Feel the emotions and adrenaline as you speed around the track at lightning speed and give it your all to reach the finish line first.<br><br><strong>Car Tune: Project</strong> is a game for automotive, tuning, and racing enthusiasts. Excellent graphics and sounds, realistic car models, and numerous personalization and tuning options make this game a real treat for fans of racing and automotive games. Enter the world of <strong>Car Tune: Project</strong> and start building your own cars - who knows, maybe you'll create a real legend?",
    "short_description": "Car Tune: Project is a dynamic game in which the player takes on the role of a car mechanic. The goal of the game is to tune, modify, and improve the performance of cars. An extensive tuning system and realistic driving physics provide a great experience for automotive enthusiasts.",
